  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "wingman",
      "text": "你做到了！Overlord 被击败了！",
      "emotion": "ecstatic",
      "portrait": "wingman-excited"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "commander",
      "text": "银河系得救了，全靠你。",
      "emotion": "grateful",
      "portrait": "commander-grateful"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "pilot",
      "text": "这不是我一个人的功劳，是大家共同的胜利。",
      "emotion": "humble",
      "portrait": "pilot-humble"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "admiral",
      "text": "飞行员，你将被授予联邦最高荣誉。",
      "emotion": "proud",
      "portrait": "admiral-proud"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "pilot",
      "text": "谢谢，将军。但和平到来才是最好的奖励。",
      "emotion": "peaceful",
      "portrait": "pilot-peaceful"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "admiral",
      "text": "说得好。愿你未来的飞行永远平安。",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "portrait": "admiral-warm"
    }
  ]
}